  "articles/what-are-the-gaps-in-building-a-quantum-computer-that-cracks-rsa-2048": {"title":"构建能破解 RSA 2048 的量子计算机，还有哪些挑战？","description":"沿芯片、冷却、控制和纠错四个方向拆解 RSA-2048 资源估计。","nodes":[{"tag":"section","style":"reading-section","children":[{"tag":"h2","id":"量子芯片","children":["量子芯片"]},{"tag":"p","children":["从千比特级单芯片到能运行深容错电路的机器，需要同时扩大规模并保持门、测量和读出的质量。IBM 的千比特芯片是物理量子比特规模的一个观测点。"]},{"tag":"p","style":"meta","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/zh/articles/what-are-the-gaps-in-building-a-quantum-computer-that-cracks-rsa-2048/#量子芯片","children":["阅读原文对应章节 ↗"]}]}]},{"tag":"section","style":"reading-section","children":[{"tag":"h3","id":"布线问题","children":["布线问题"]},{"tag":"p","children":["单一平面难以给大量内部比特送入控制与读出信号。多层互连、硅通孔与封装会改变密度、热负载及信号损耗。"]},{"tag":"p","style":"meta","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/zh/articles/what-are-the-gaps-in-building-a-quantum-computer-that-cracks-rsa-2048/#布线问题","children":["阅读原文对应章节 ↗"]}]}]},{"tag":"section","style":"reading-section","children":[{"tag":"h3","id":"串扰问题","children":["串扰问题"]},{"tag":"p","children":["比特之间的非预期耦合会随通道和频率密度上升。布局、隔离和并行校准需要压低相关错误。"]},{"tag":"p","style":"meta","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/zh/articles/what-are-the-gaps-in-building-a-quantum-computer-that-cracks-rsa-2048/#串扰问题","children":["阅读原文对应章节 ↗"]}]}]},{"tag":"section","style":"reading-section","children":[{"tag":"h3","id":"器件良品率问题","children":["器件良品率问题"]},{"tag":"p","children":["器件数增加时，重复工艺的一致性决定芯片能有多少可用比特，维修策略和容错编码也会改变芯片利用率。"]},{"tag":"p","style":"meta","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/zh/articles/what-are-the-gaps-in-building-a-quantum-computer-that-cracks-rsa-2048/#器件良品率问题","children":["阅读原文对应章节 ↗"]}]}]},{"tag":"section","style":"reading-section","children":[{"tag":"h3","id":"希望的曙光模块化设计与片间互联","children":["希望的曙光：模块化设计与片间互联"]},{"tag":"p","children":["可重复制造的小模块能把单片良率的约束转到片间链路。模块化方案需要证明跨片门、纠缠传输和同步满足目标误差预算。"]},{"tag":"p","style":"meta","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/zh/articles/what-are-the-gaps-in-building-a-quantum-computer-that-cracks-rsa-2048/#希望的曙光模块化设计与片间互联","children":["阅读原文对应章节 ↗"]}]}]},{"tag":"section","style":"reading-section","children":[{"tag":"h3","id":"总结","children":["总结"]},{"tag":"p","children":["评估系统规模时要同时查看可校准的比特数、门错误率、模块互连质量和可运行的纠错周期。"]},{"tag":"p","style":"meta","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/zh/articles/what-are-the-gaps-in-building-a-quantum-computer-that-cracks-rsa-2048/#总结","children":["阅读原文对应章节 ↗"]}]}]},{"tag":"section","style":"reading-section","children":[{"tag":"h2","id":"制冷系统","children":["制冷系统"]},{"tag":"p","children":["跨温区的线缆有热传导，低温器件也消耗制冷功率。融入复用与多温区电子学后要复核读出信噪比。"]},{"tag":"p","style":"meta","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/zh/articles/what-are-the-gaps-in-building-a-quantum-computer-that-cracks-rsa-2048/#制冷系统","children":["阅读原文对应章节 ↗"]}]}]},{"tag":"section","style":"reading-section","children":[{"tag":"h2","id":"量子比特控制系统","children":["量子比特控制系统"]},{"tag":"p","children":["大规模控制需要更多同步通道。脉冲生成、采样、反馈、校准和实时解码会消耗经典算力与带宽。"]},{"tag":"p","style":"meta","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/zh/articles/what-are-the-gaps-in-building-a-quantum-computer-that-cracks-rsa-2048/#量子比特控制系统","children":["阅读原文对应章节 ↗"]}]}]},{"tag":"section","style":"reading-section","children":[{"tag":"h2","id":"纠错系统","children":["纠错系统"]},{"tag":"p","children":["容错门的成本由物理错误率、码距、逻辑门数及魔态资源共同决定。低于表面码阈值的实验展示了关键条件，扩展到长算法还要持续验证。"]},{"tag":"p","style":"meta","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/zh/articles/what-are-the-gaps-in-building-a-quantum-computer-that-cracks-rsa-2048/#纠错系统","children":["阅读原文对应章节 ↗"]}]}]},{"tag":"section","style":"reading-section","children":[{"tag":"h2","id":"破解-rsa2048-的量子计算机高概率在-203x-年出现","children":["破解 RSA2048 的量子计算机高概率在 203X 年出现"]},{"tag":"p","children":["原文章把 2030 年代作为风险研判区间。日期依赖错误率、体系结构、集成能力与算法资源模型。应结合具体量子硬件进展和研究假设理解，并参考迁移规划中的数据保护期限。"]},{"tag":"p","style":"meta","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/zh/articles/what-are-the-gaps-in-building-a-quantum-computer-that-cracks-rsa-2048/#破解-rsa2048-的量子计算机高概率在-203x-年出现","children":["阅读原文对应章节 ↗"]}]}]},{"tag":"section","style":"reading-section","children":[{"tag":"h2","id":"original-figures","children":["原文图例"]},{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/_astro/wiring.V-17Qp48_Z17PueW.webp","children":["随着量子比特数量增加"]}]},{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/_astro/crosstalk.Cz-uhRJ3_Z1FIzYK.webp","children":["串扰随量子比特数量增加呈非线性增强"]}]},{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/_astro/device-yield.DR91tieI_2oW9lq.webp","children":["面积随着量子比特数量以N²增长"]}]},{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/_astro/chiplet-interconnection.OchHlwjj_9C1Cu.webp","children":["Chiplet跨稀释制冷机互联会引入额外热噪声"]}]},{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/_astro/chiplets-in-same-refrigerator.CsXRA-vJ_2sGdvD.webp","children":["多个Chiplet 被放置在同一稀释制冷机内"]}]},{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/_astro/thermal-interference.DfAMqdpp_vEud4.webp","children":["量子比特的三大热干扰源"]}]},{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/_astro/cooling-layers.CFJFb_aF_1H5QNQ.webp","children":["稀释制冷机分级降温系统"]}]},{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/_astro/cooling-challenge.CYScAVmq_2ijtEJ.webp","children":["从百比特到百万比特"]}]},{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/_astro/signal-interference.C7VxKUy4_5nc6x.webp","children":["相邻频率太接近时"]}]},{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/_astro/signal-stability-control.BXDPh593_ZruHBv.webp","children":["频带变窄后"]}]},{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/_astro/million-channels.BQhz4HE7_Z25qzj2.webp","children":["如果有百万个量子比特"]}]},{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","href":"https://pqc.tencent.com/_astro/logical-qubit.CwXd2xSQ_kGOa8.webp","children":["多个易受干